    "Ik wil dit wel gaan regelen, zal ik 2 open tikkies sturen?": {},
    "It is on your server, but it didn't answer Chatman. Its log on the server says why; once it's running again, this screen will connect you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hij staat op je server, maar antwoordde Chatman niet. Het log op de server zegt waarom; zodra hij weer draait, koppelt dit scherm je."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is still there for everyone else. %@": {
